    "created_at": "2016-06-17T16:53:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-17T16:53:18Z",
    "body": "It's a parser \"macro\", not an element, and therefore not really a synonym. E.g., `document.createElement(\"image\")` does not give an `HTMLImageElement`.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
