    "updated_at": "2016-06-17T16:59:38Z",
    "body": "True... just wondering if some other people will accidentally miss it when building such hash tables. Perhaps at least include it in the list at https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/syntax.html#special? (`The following elements have varying levels of special parsing rules:` - since it indeed has special parsing rules)\n",
