    "created_at": "2016-06-17T18:08:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-17T18:08:37Z",
    "body": "What sort of hash table are you trying to build?  If you're doing something with parsing, you should be following the actual parser, which will handle \"image\" just fine.  If you're doing literally anything else, you shouldn't see \"image\", just \"img\", right?\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
