    "created_at": "2016-06-17T18:24:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-17T18:24:14Z",
    "body": "> If you're doing literally anything else, you shouldn't see \"image\", just \"img\", right?\n\nNot necessarily \"just\", I'm seeing both as it's important for our implementation to keep the source untouched whenever possible.\n\nAnyway, this is not that much about implementation-specific behavior, rather about including it in the generic notes / tables - I thought it would be useful to keep all the \"magic names\" in some sort of centralized lists in docs and this appears to be the only miss because it technically doesn't belong to neither of categories.\n",
